---
import LegalDocLayout from "../../../components/LegalDocLayout.astro";

const title = "Cookie policy — PRIME";
const description = "How PRIME uses cookies on the English version of prime-ltd.su.";
---

<LegalDocLayout title={title} description={description} path="/en/legal/cookies/">
  <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-lead">
    Cookie usage policy of PRIME LLC (ООО «ПРАЙМ») for
    <a href="https://prime-ltd.su/en/">https://prime-ltd.su/en/</a>.
    Related: <a href="/en/legal/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>1. General</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small pieces of data stored by your browser when you visit a website. We use them
    to run the site, remember preferences (for example language choice), measure visits and — where
    enabled — improve marketing effectiveness. Processing of related personal data follows Russian
    Federal Law No. 152-FZ “On Personal Data”.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Types of cookies we may use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Session</strong> — stored temporarily while you browse and usually deleted when you
      close the browser.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Persistent</strong> — stored on your device for a set period (for example locale
      preference or cookie consent).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Analytics / marketing</strong> — help us understand how the site is used and improve
      content and campaigns.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Essential</strong> — required for basic operation, security and consent storage.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. How to refuse cookies</h2>
  <p>
    Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in settings. If you refuse non-essential cookies,
    the site will keep working with essential cookies only; some features (analytics, personalised
    offers) may be limited.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Consent notice</h2>
  <p>
    By continuing to use the site after seeing our cookie notice, you agree to the use of cookies
    and related processing described here and in the Privacy policy, unless you have disabled
    cookies in the browser.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Security and changes</h2>
  <p>
    Data collected via cookies is treated as confidential and protected under applicable law. We
    may update this policy; the current English text is published on this page. Questions:
    <a href="mailto:info@prime-ltd.su">info@prime-ltd.su</a>.
  </p>
</LegalDocLayout>
